{"items": [{"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/san-pham/safety-barrier/bo-nguon-an-toan-noi-tai-eaton-mtl-949x-ps/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/dhdeojkm/mtl9493-ps.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd648675476a26\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">B&#x1ED9; ngu&#x1ED3;n an to&#xE0;n n&#x1ED9;i t&#x1EA1;i Eaton MTL 949x-PS</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">B&#x1ED9; ngu&#x1ED3;n c&#xE1;ch ly an to&#xE0;n n&#x1ED9;i t&#x1EA1;i: &#x111;&#x1EA7;u v&#xE0;o 24 V DC, &#x111;&#x1EA7;u ra Ex ia 4,8 &#x2013; 17,7 V cho thi&#x1EBF;t b&#x1ECB; &#x111;&#x1EB7;t trong Zone 0/1, nh&#xF3;m kh&#xED; IIB/IIC; l&#x1EAF;p v&#xF9;ng an to&#xE0;n ho&#x1EB7;c Zone 2.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">Xem chi ti&#x1EBF;t →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"giaiphap": ["an-toan-vung-nguy-hiem", "tu-dong-hoa-dieu-khien"]}}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/san-pham/safety-barrier/bo-cach-ly-an-toan-noi-tai-eaton-mtl4500/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/1fxm0cgb/mtl4500-is.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd64867522903f\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">B&#x1ED9; c&#xE1;ch ly an to&#xE0;n n&#x1ED9;i t&#x1EA1;i Eaton MTL4500 (l&#x1EAF;p backplane)</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">B&#x1ED9; c&#xE1;ch ly an to&#xE0;n n&#x1ED9;i t&#x1EA1;i l&#x1EAF;p backplane cho DCS, ESD v&#xE0; F&amp;G &#x2013; m&#x1EAD;t &#x111;&#x1ED9; k&#xEA;nh cao nh&#x1EA5;t, c&#xE1;ch ly 3 c&#x1ED5;ng, t&#x1ED5;n hao th&#x1EA5;p, nhi&#x1EC1;u model &#x111;&#xE1;nh gi&#xE1; SIL.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">Xem chi ti&#x1EBF;t →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"giaiphap": ["an-toan-vung-nguy-hiem", "tu-dong-hoa-dieu-khien"]}}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/san-pham/safety-barrier/cach-ly-tin-hieu-isolated-barriers/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/ws3geiqq/mtl5500-is.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd648675313a02\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">B&#x1ED9; c&#xE1;ch ly an to&#xE0;n n&#x1ED9;i t&#x1EA1;i Eaton MTL5500 (l&#x1EAF;p DIN rail)</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">B&#x1ED9; c&#xE1;ch ly an to&#xE0;n n&#x1ED9;i t&#x1EA1;i MTL5500 l&#x1EAF;p DIN rail, th&#xE2;n m&#x1ECF;ng, module 1 v&#xE0; nhi&#x1EC1;u k&#xEA;nh, c&#xE1;ch ly 3 c&#x1ED5;ng, &#x111;&#x1EA7;u n&#x1ED1;i th&#xE1;o r&#x1EDD;i &#x2013; t&#x1EEB; m&#x1ED9;t v&#xF2;ng &#x111;o &#x111;&#x1EBF;n c&#x1EA3; t&#x1EE7;.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">Xem chi ti&#x1EBF;t →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"giaiphap": ["an-toan-vung-nguy-hiem", "tu-dong-hoa-dieu-khien"]}}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/san-pham/safety-barrier/zener-barriers/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/5orcw1lv/mtl7700-zener.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd6486753c480a\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Zener barrier an to&#xE0;n n&#x1ED9;i t&#x1EA1;i Eaton MTL7700</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Zener barrier MTL7700 l&#x1EAF;p DIN rail: d&#xF9;ng diode Zener, &#x111;i&#x1EC7;n tr&#x1EDF; v&#xE0; c&#x1EA7;u ch&#xEC; &#x111;&#x1EC3; tri&#x1EC7;t ti&#xEA;u n&#x103;ng l&#x1B0;&#x1EE3;ng th&#x1EEB;a xu&#x1ED1;ng &#x111;&#x1EA5;t &#x2013; kinh t&#x1EBF;, g&#x1ECD;n, &#x111;&#x1EA7;u n&#x1ED1;i th&#xE1;o r&#x1EDD;i, ti&#x1EBF;p &#x111;&#x1EA5;t IS qua thanh ray.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">Xem chi ti&#x1EBF;t →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"giaiphap": ["an-toan-vung-nguy-hiem", "tu-dong-hoa-dieu-khien"]}}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/san-pham/safety-barrier/bo-cach-ly-fieldbus-an-toan-noi-tai-eaton-mtl/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/ybzch14o/mtlfb-1.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd5fc162e03469\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">B&#x1ED9; c&#xE1;ch ly Fieldbus an to&#xE0;n n&#x1ED9;i t&#x1EA1;i Eaton MTL</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Fieldbus barrier c&#x1EA5;p nh&#xE1;nh spur an to&#xE0;n n&#x1ED9;i t&#x1EA1;i t&#x1EEB; trunk n&#x103;ng l&#x1B0;&#x1EE3;ng cao cho thi&#x1EBF;t b&#x1ECB; FOUNDATION&#x2122; fieldbus H1 &#x2013; l&#x1EAF;p Zone 1/21, spur v&#xE0;o Zone 0.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">Xem chi ti&#x1EBF;t →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"giaiphap": ["an-toan-vung-nguy-hiem", "tu-dong-hoa-dieu-khien"]}}], "size": 5}